// A story crawl. Shown by a story consequence `Emit(effect: "crawl:level_01_crawl_intro")`
// (the id is the file name). Every field is optional; see `lava_ui_builder::crawl::CrawlSpec`.
//   style:        Scroll(tilt: 1.0)  rolls up the screen (0 = flat credits, up to 4)
//                 Typewriter         a dialog box, one page per line
//   speed:        Scroll: pixels per second. Typewriter: characters per second.
//   backdrop:     0 = see-through .. 1 = black
//   modal:        true pauses the match until it is done (default)
//   skippable:    a scroll can be cut short (default true)
//   auto_advance: Typewriter: seconds before a finished page turns by itself (0 = wait)
//   hint:         Typewriter: prompt shown once a page is typed
// Plain ASCII only: the game's font has nothing else.
(
    title: "EPISODE I: THE LAWN MENACE",
    lines: [
        "It is a quiet Tuesday on Maple Drive.",
        "The sprinklers hiss. The barbecues smoke. Nobody has noticed the strange lights over the cul-de-sac.",
        "",
        "Nobody except YOU, the last line of defence of the Homeowners' Association, armed with a garden hose and a deep distrust of anything green that is not a lawn.",
        "",
        "Hold the street. Do not let them reach the end of the road...",
    ],
    style: Scroll(tilt: 1.2),
    speed: 55.0,
    backdrop: 0.85,
)
